---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const updated = '6 June 2026';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy — Latentsig AI" description="Privacy Policy for Latentsig AI.">
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-grid-pattern">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-surface/40 via-surface/70 to-surface"></div>
    <div class="relative max-w-max-width mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop py-24">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 max-w-4xl">
        <span class="text-primary font-label-md text-label-md font-bold tracking-widest uppercase">Legal</span>
        <h1 class="font-headline-xl text-headline-xl-mobile md:text-headline-xl text-on-surface leading-tight">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant tracking-widest uppercase">Last updated: {updated}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Body -->
  <section class="py-24 bg-surface">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop flex flex-col gap-12">
      <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant">
        Latentsig AI ("we", "us") operates latentsig.com. This policy explains, plainly, what
        information this website handles. The short version: this is a static website — we do not
        run analytics, set cookies, or collect personal data through it.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">1. What we collect</h2>
        <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
          Nothing, directly. This site has no user accounts, no analytics or tracking scripts, and
          sets no cookies of its own. The contact form does not submit anything to our servers — it
          opens your own email client with a pre-filled draft that you choose whether to send.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">2. Email you send us</h2>
        <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
          If you email us, we receive whatever you choose to include — typically your name, email
          address, and message. We use it only to respond to you and to conduct any engagement that
          follows. We do not sell it, share it for marketing, or add you to mailing lists without
          your consent.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">3. Third-party services</h2>
        <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
          When this site loads in your browser, a few assets are fetched from third parties: fonts
          and icons from Google Fonts, and styling from the Tailwind CSS CDN. The site is hosted on
          GitHub Pages. These providers see your IP address and standard request metadata as part of
          serving those files, governed by their own privacy policies. We do not receive that data.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">4. Your rights</h2>
        <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
          You may ask us at any time what information we hold about you (for most visitors: none),
          and to correct or delete it. Write to
          <a class="text-primary hover:underline" href="mailto:latentsig@gmail.com">latentsig@gmail.com</a>
          and we will respond promptly.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">5. Changes</h2>
        <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
          If we add anything that changes what data this site handles — for example analytics or a
          server-backed contact form — we will update this policy and the date above before doing so.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">6. Contact</h2>
        <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
          Questions about this policy:
          <a class="text-primary hover:underline" href="mailto:latentsig@gmail.com">latentsig@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
